OL,3,AHundreds missing, including 291 foreign
OL,4,Atourists, after deadly flash flood on
OL,5,ANepal-Tibet border
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of travellers are missing,
OL,8,Fincluding at least 291 foreign
OL,9,Ftourists, after a flash flood on the
OL,10,FNepal-Tibet border
OL,12,FAt least 18 people have been killed in
OL,13,FNepal - among the preliminary list of
OL,14,Fthe missing are more than 100 people
OL,15,Ffrom India and 12 from the UK,
OL,16,Faccording to its tourist board
OL,18,FChinese state media is also reporting
OL,19,F"major casualties" in Tibet, which is
OL,20,Fcontrolled by China
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
