OL,3,AHundreds missing, including 291 foreign
OL,4,Atourists, after deadly flash flood on
OL,5,ANepal-Tibet border
OL,6,
OL,7,FVerified videos from Nepal show a
OL,8,Fbridge being swept away and
OL,9,Fmulti-storey buildings collapsed by the
OL,10,Fforce of floodwaters
OL,12,FOther images show houses partially
OL,13,Fsubmerged after muddy floodwater swept
OL,14,Fthrough Nepal's Nuwakot district
OL,16,FNepal's foreign minister says
OL,17,Fpreliminary reports show it may have
OL,18,Fbeen caused by an earthquake triggering
OL,19,Fan avalanche, which lead to flash
OL,20,Ffloods
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
